<!-- 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW                                    -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<h1 id="sec1"><span class="section-num">01</span> Project Overview</h1>

<p><b>SleepSync AI</b> is an educational wellness web application that helps users understand their self-reported sleep and daily energy patterns. Users fill out a 6-field sleep questionnaire, and the app generates personalized informational reports with practical sleep-routine suggestions. Users can also download their analysis as a professionally formatted PDF report.</p>

<div class="info-box warning">
  <b>&#9888; Important Disclaimer:</b> This is an informational wellness tool, NOT a medical diagnostic application. It does not diagnose sleep disorders, determine biological chronotypes, or provide medical advice.
</div>

<h2>Project Objectives</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Provide a user-friendly interface for entering sleep pattern data</li>
  <li>Analyze sleep data using AI (Google Gemini) or rule-based algorithms</li>
  <li>Generate personalized, actionable sleep suggestions</li>
  <li>Create downloadable professional PDF reports</li>
  <li>Work fully offline without requiring an AI API key</li>
  <li>Maintain user privacy &mdash; no data is stored or persisted</li>
</ul>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- 2. FEATURES & FUNCTIONS                                -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<h1 id="sec2"><span class="section-num">02</span> Features &amp; Functions</h1>

<h2>Core Features</h2>

<table class="data-table">
  <tr>
    <th style="width:25%">Feature</th>
    <th>Description</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>&#128716; Sleep Questionnaire</b></td>
    <td>6-field interactive form with bedtime, wake-up time, energy peak, preferred schedule, sleep duration slider, and optional notes. Client-side validation with clear error messages.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><b>&#129302; AI-Powered Analysis</b></td>
    <td>Uses Google Gemini API (gemini-2.0-flash model) for natural language sleep pattern analysis with personalized, conversational insights.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>&#128202; Rule-Based Fallback</b></td>
    <td>Deterministic scoring algorithm (0&ndash;9 scale) that works without any API key or internet connection. Automatically activates when AI is unavailable.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><b>&#128196; PDF Report Generator</b></td>
    <td>Server-side PDF generation using QuestPDF. Creates branded A4 reports with all analysis sections, page numbering, and professional layout.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>&#127769; Dark Mode UI</b></td>
    <td>Premium dark theme with glassmorphism effects, gradient accents, Inter typography, and smooth micro-animations for a modern look.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><b>&#128274; Privacy First</b></td>
    <td>No data persistence, no user accounts, no cookies. Stateless architecture ensures all data is processed in-memory and never stored.</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<h2>Complete Function List</h2>

<table class="data-table">
  <tr>
    <th>Function</th>
    <th>Layer</th>
    <th>Description</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>analyzeSleep(data)</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-frontend">Frontend</span></td>
    <td>Sends questionnaire data to backend via POST request and returns structured analysis</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><code>downloadReport(data)</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-frontend">Frontend</span></td>
    <td>Requests PDF from backend, creates a blob URL, and triggers automatic browser download</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>extractError(error)</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-frontend">Frontend</span></td>
    <td>Parses Axios errors into user-friendly messages (validation, network, server, blob errors)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><code>handleChange(field, value)</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-frontend">Frontend</span></td>
    <td>Updates form state and clears field-specific validation errors on edit</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>validate()</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-frontend">Frontend</span></td>
    <td>Client-side validation for required fields, notes length (max 500 chars)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><code>handleAnalyze(data)</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-frontend">Frontend</span></td>
    <td>Orchestrates analysis flow: set loading, call API, display results, smooth scroll</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>handleDownloadReport()</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-frontend">Frontend</span></td>
    <td>Orchestrates PDF download flow: set loading, call report API, handle errors</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><code>Analyze(request)</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-backend">Backend</span></td>
    <td>Controller action: validates request, sanitizes HTML from notes, runs analysis, returns JSON</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>GenerateReport(request)</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-backend">Backend</span></td>
    <td>Controller action: re-runs analysis server-side, generates PDF, returns as file download</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><code>AnalyzeAsync(request)</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-service">Service</span></td>
    <td>Interface method implemented by both RuleBasedAnalyzerService and GeminiAnalyzerService</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>CalculateSleepDuration()</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-service">Service</span></td>
    <td>Calculates hours between bedtime and wake-up, correctly handling overnight schedules (e.g., 23:00 &rarr; 07:00 = 8h)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><code>DeterminePreference()</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-service">Service</span></td>
    <td>Score-based preference classification: 0&ndash;2 = Early-oriented, 3&ndash;5 = Intermediate, 6&ndash;9 = Late-oriented</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>BuildSummary()</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-service">Service</span></td>
    <td>Generates natural-language summary of the user's reported sleep pattern</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><code>GenerateSuggestions()</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-service">Service</span></td>
    <td>Creates 3 personalized suggestions based on sleep duration, energy alignment, and bedtime habits</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>GenerateRecommendations()</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-service">Service</span></td>
    <td>Returns 5 general sleep hygiene recommendations</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><code>FormatTime()</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-service">Service</span></td>
    <td>Converts 24-hour TimeSpan to 12-hour AM/PM display format</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>BuildPrompt()</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-service">Service</span></td>
    <td>Constructs the Gemini AI prompt with user data, safety rules, and expected JSON schema</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><code>ParseAiResponse()</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-service">Service</span></td>
    <td>Cleans and deserializes the AI JSON response, strips markdown fences, validates essential fields</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>GenerateReport()</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-service">Service</span></td>
    <td>Creates A4 PDF with QuestPDF: header, 6 content sections, branded styling, footer with page numbers</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><code>SectionHeading()</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-service">Service</span></td>
    <td>Reusable PDF layout helper for section titles</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>InfoRow()</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-service">Service</span></td>
    <td>Reusable PDF layout helper for label-value info rows</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><code>FormatEnergyPeak()</code></td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-service">Service</span></td>
    <td>Converts enum values like &quot;EarlyMorning&quot; to display text &quot;Early Morning&quot;</td>
  </tr>
</table>

