&#9474;  &#9474; RuleBasedEngine &#9474;  &#9474;                &#9474;
&#9474;  &#9474; (Fallback)      &#9474;  &#9474;                &#9474;
&#9474;  &#9492;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9496;  &#9474;                &#9474;
&#9492;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9496;
</div>

<h2>Request Flow</h2>
<ol>
  <li><b>User fills form</b> &rarr; Client-side validation runs &rarr; Data sent via Axios POST</li>
  <li><b>Backend validates</b> &rarr; Regex time format check &rarr; HTML sanitization on notes</li>
  <li><b>Analysis runs</b> &rarr; Gemini AI (if key configured) OR Rule-Based fallback</li>
  <li><b>Response returned</b> &rarr; JSON with summary, preference, suggestions, recommendations, disclaimer</li>
  <li><b>Results displayed</b> &rarr; Fade-in animation, smooth scroll to results section</li>
  <li><b>PDF download</b> &rarr; Same data re-analyzed server-side &rarr; QuestPDF generates A4 &rarr; Blob download</li>
</ol>

