<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- 8. API ENDPOINTS                                       -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<h1 id="sec8"><span class="section-num">08</span> API Endpoints</h1>

<h2>POST /api/sleep/analyze</h2>
<p>Analyzes sleep questionnaire data and returns personalized insights.</p>

<h3>Request Body (JSON)</h3>
<pre><code>{
  "bedtime": "23:00",
  "wakeUpTime": "07:00",
  "energyPeak": "LateMorning",
  "preferredSchedule": "Flexible",
  "averageSleepHours": 8,
  "notes": ""
}</code></pre>

<h3>Validation Rules</h3>
<table class="data-table">
  <tr><th>Field</th><th>Required</th><th>Validation</th><th>Accepted Values</th></tr>
  <tr><td><code>bedtime</code></td><td>Yes</td><td>HH:mm regex + TimeSpan parse</td><td>00:00 &ndash; 23:59</td></tr>
  <tr class="alt"><td><code>wakeUpTime</code></td><td>Yes</td><td>HH:mm regex + TimeSpan parse</td><td>00:00 &ndash; 23:59</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>energyPeak</code></td><td>Yes</td><td>Regex enum match</td><td>EarlyMorning, LateMorning, Afternoon, Evening, Night</td></tr>
  <tr class="alt"><td><code>preferredSchedule</code></td><td>Yes</td><td>Regex enum match</td><td>Early, Flexible, Late</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>averageSleepHours</code></td><td>Yes</td><td>Range 1&ndash;24</td><td>Decimal allowed (e.g., 7.5)</td></tr>
  <tr class="alt"><td><code>notes</code></td><td>No</td><td>Max 500 chars, HTML stripped</td><td>Free text</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>Success Response (200 OK)</h3>
<pre><code>{
  "summary": "Based on your reported schedule...",
  "estimatedPreference": "Intermediate",
  "reportedSleepDuration": "8 hours (calculated interval: ~8 hours)",
  "suggestions": ["...","...","..."],
  "generalRecommendations": ["...","...","...","...","..."],
  "disclaimer": "This is an informal wellness estimate..."
}</code></pre>

<h3>Validation Error (400 Bad Request)</h3>
<pre><code>{
  "errors": {
    "Bedtime": ["Bedtime is required."],
    "EnergyPeak": ["Energy peak must be one of: ..."]
  }
}</code></pre>

<hr>

<h2>POST /api/sleep/report</h2>
<p>Generates and returns a PDF report. Accepts the same request body as /analyze.</p>
<p><b>Response:</b> <code>application/pdf</code> binary file with <code>Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="SleepSync-Report.pdf"</code></p>
<p>The analysis is re-run server-side to ensure data integrity &mdash; no client-supplied analysis data is trusted.</p>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- 9. ANALYSIS ENGINE                                     -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<h1 id="sec9"><span class="section-num">09</span> How the Analysis Engine Works</h1>

<h2>Dual-Engine Architecture</h2>
<table class="data-table">
  <tr><th>Engine</th><th>Activation Condition</th><th>Internet Required</th><th>Response Style</th></tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>GeminiAnalyzerService</b></td>
    <td>Gemini API key is configured</td>
    <td>Yes</td>
    <td>Natural language, conversational, AI-generated</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><b>RuleBasedAnalyzerService</b></td>
    <td>No API key OR Gemini fails</td>
    <td>No &mdash; fully offline</td>
    <td>Template-based, deterministic, consistent</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<h2>Rule-Based Scoring Algorithm</h2>
<p>The fallback engine uses a 3-factor scoring system to estimate schedule preference:</p>

<table class="data-table">
  <tr><th>Factor</th><th>Score 0</th><th>Score 1</th><th>Score 2</th><th>Score 3</th><th>Score 4</th></tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>Bedtime</b></td><td>8&ndash;10 PM</td><td>10&ndash;11:30 PM</td><td>11:30 PM&ndash;1 AM</td><td>1&ndash;4 AM</td><td>&mdash;</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><b>Energy Peak</b></td><td>Early Morning</td><td>Late Morning</td><td>Afternoon</td><td>Evening</td><td>Night</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>Preferred Schedule</b></td><td>Early</td><td>Flexible</td><td>Late</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>&mdash;</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p><b>Total score range: 0&ndash;9</b></p>
<ul>
  <li><b>0&ndash;2:</b> Early-oriented</li>
  <li><b>3&ndash;5:</b> Intermediate</li>
  <li><b>6&ndash;9:</b> Late-oriented</li>
</ul>

<h2>Overnight Sleep Duration Calculation</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Same-day: <code>01:00 &rarr; 09:00</code> = 8 hours (wakeUp &minus; bedtime)</li>
  <li>Overnight: <code>23:00 &rarr; 07:00</code> = 8 hours (24 &minus; bedtime + wakeUp)</li>
</ul>

<h2>Personalized Suggestions Logic</h2>
<p>Three contextual suggestions are generated based on:</p>
<ol>
  <li><b>Sleep duration:</b> Under 6h (increase), over 9h (consult doctor), 6&ndash;9h (maintain)</li>
  <li><b>Energy alignment:</b> Morning peak + late schedule (misaligned), evening peak + early schedule (misaligned), else (well-aligned)</li>
  <li><b>Bedtime habits:</b> After midnight (darkness advice), before 10 PM (protect schedule), else (reduce screen time)</li>
</ol>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- 10. PDF REPORT                                         -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<h1 id="sec10"><span class="section-num">10</span> PDF Report Details</h1>

<p>The PDF is generated entirely server-side using the QuestPDF library (Community License).</p>

<h2>Report Layout Sections</h2>
<table class="data-table">
  <tr><th>Section</th><th>Content</th><th>Styling</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Header</td><td>&ldquo;SleepSync AI&rdquo; branding + subtitle + date</td><td>Teal accent, 24pt bold, horizontal rule</td></tr>
  <tr class="alt"><td>1. Sleep Schedule</td><td>Bedtime, Wake-up, Peak Energy, Schedule, Duration, Notes</td><td>Label-value rows, bold labels</td></tr>
  <tr><td>2. Pattern Summary</td><td>Natural language summary paragraph</td><td>11pt text, 1.5&times; line height</td></tr>
  <tr class="alt"><td>3. Estimated Preference</td><td>Preference badge + explanatory note</td><td>Teal background badge, italic footnote</td></tr>
  <tr><td>4. Suggestions</td><td>Numbered list (1, 2, 3)</td><td>Teal numbered markers</td></tr>
  <tr class="alt"><td>5. Recommendations</td><td>Bulleted list (5 items)</td><td>Teal bullet markers</td></tr>
  <tr><td>6. Disclaimer</td><td>Disclaimer text in grey box</td><td>Light grey background, 9pt italic</td></tr>
  <tr class="alt"><td>Footer</td><td>&ldquo;SleepSync AI &mdash; Wellness Report&rdquo; + page numbers</td><td>8pt grey, &ldquo;Page X of Y&rdquo;</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Brand Colors in PDF</h2>
<table class="data-table">
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Hex Code</th><th>Usage</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Primary</td><td><code>#0F172A</code></td><td>Body text, section headings</td></tr>
  <tr class="alt"><td>Accent</td><td><code>#14B8A6</code></td><td>Title, badge, horizontal rules, list markers</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Light Background</td><td><code>#F8FAFC</code></td><td>Disclaimer box background</td></tr>
</table>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- 11. CONFIGURATION                                      -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<h1 id="sec11"><span class="section-num">11</span> Configuration &amp; Setup</h1>

<h2>Running the Application</h2>

<h3>Backend (Terminal 1)</h3>
<pre><code>cd SleepSyncAI\SleepSyncAI.Api
dotnet restore
dotnet build
dotnet run --launch-profile http</code></pre>
<p>&rarr; Starts on <code>http://localhost:5062</code> &nbsp;|&nbsp; Swagger at <code>/swagger</code></p>

<h3>Frontend (Terminal 2)</h3>
<pre><code>cd SleepSyncAI\sleepsyncai.client
npm install
npm run dev</code></pre>
<p>&rarr; Starts on <code>http://localhost:5173</code></p>

<h2>Configuring the Gemini API Key (Optional)</h2>

<div class="info-box note">
  <b>&#128161; Note:</b> The app works fully without an API key using the rule-based fallback. The Gemini API key is optional and only needed for AI-powered natural language analysis.
</div>

<h3>Option 1: .NET User Secrets (Recommended)</h3>
<pre><code>cd SleepSyncAI\SleepSyncAI.Api
dotnet user-secrets init
dotnet user-secrets set "Gemini:ApiKey" "your-api-key-here"</code></pre>

<h3>Option 2: Environment Variable</h3>
<pre><code>$env:GEMINI_API_KEY = "your-api-key-here"</code></pre>

<h2>Configuration Files</h2>
<table class="data-table">
  <tr><th>File</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
  <tr><td><code>appsettings.json</code></td><td>Logging levels, allowed hosts, Gemini API key + model name</td></tr>
  <tr class="alt"><td><code>appsettings.Development.json</code></td><td>Development-specific log level overrides</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>launchSettings.json</code></td><td>HTTP launch profile (port 5062), environment setting</td></tr>
  <tr class="alt"><td><code>vite.config.js</code></td><td>Vite dev server port (5173), React plugin</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>package.json</code></td><td>NPM scripts (dev, build, preview), dependencies</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>CORS Configuration</h2>
<p>The backend allows requests from:</p>
<ul>
  <li><code>http://localhost:5173</code> &mdash; Vite dev server (default)</li>
  <li><code>http://localhost:3000</code> &mdash; Alternate dev port</li>
</ul>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- 12. SECURITY                                           -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<h1 id="sec12"><span class="section-num">12</span> Security Measures</h1>

<table class="data-table">
  <tr><th>Measure</th><th>Implementation</th></tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>API Key Protection</b></td>
    <td>Gemini API key is read server-side only from User Secrets, appsettings, or environment variable. Never sent to frontend.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><b>Input Validation</b></td>
    <td>Data annotations + regex on all required fields. Additional TimeSpan.TryParse check on time fields.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>HTML Sanitization</b></td>
    <td>Notes field is stripped of all HTML tags using Regex.Replace before processing.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><b>Error Handling</b></td>
    <td>Global exception handler returns generic error message. Stack traces are never exposed to clients.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>CORS Policy</b></td>
    <td>Restricted to specific frontend origins. Not open to all origins.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><b>Server-Side Report</b></td>
    <td>PDF report re-runs analysis on the server. Client cannot inject fabricated analysis data.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>No Data Persistence</b></td>
    <td>No database, no cookies, no sessions. All data processed in-memory and discarded.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td><b>AI Safety Prompt</b></td>
    <td>Gemini prompt includes strict rules: no medical diagnosis, no chronotype claims, cautious language.</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- 13. LIMITATIONS                                        -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<h1 id="sec13"><span class="section-num">13</span> Known Limitations</h1>

<table class="data-table">
  <tr><th>Limitation</th><th>Details</th><th>Reason</th></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>No data persistence</td>
    <td>Sleep data is not saved between sessions</td>
    <td>MVP design decision &mdash; stateless architecture</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td>No user authentication</td>
    <td>No login, no accounts, no saved history</td>
    <td>Privacy-first design &mdash; no user data stored</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>AI availability</td>
    <td>Gemini API requires API key and internet</td>
    <td>Rule-based fallback works fully offline</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td>PDF fonts</td>
    <td>Uses system fonts; appearance may vary across OS</td>
    <td>QuestPDF uses fonts available on the server machine</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Single-page app</td>
    <td>No routing &mdash; entire app is one page</td>
    <td>MVP scope &mdash; single questionnaire + results flow</td>
  </tr>
  <tr class="alt">
    <td>Not a medical tool</td>
    <td>Cannot diagnose sleep disorders or determine biological chronotype</td>
    <td>Educational/wellness purpose only</td>
  </tr>
</table>

